From a96010c7d3dd63972ceb7257de4446bdb5788e40 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: claxten10 <claxten10@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 20 Nov 2025 01:09:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Revert "stagefright: distinguish HAL name from name in
 MediaCodecInfo"

* Resolves C2 crashes on MediaTek devices after Android 16 release.

This reverts commit c996a72341de09f0bf18fea5c64620077f4e4648.

Change-Id: I58fb4c18d3a2d20d3acadd75ca75c5020f9a2294
Signed-off-by: claxten10 <claxten10@gmail.com>
Signed-off-by: rajdeep-3305 <rajdeepbiswas3305@gmail.com>
---
